Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:29.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:03.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣莎拉教堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:48.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神赐恩宠）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:17.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汝不可杀人）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:28.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（创世纪）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:35.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（吃我肉 喝我血者将获永生）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:05.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们行善 不可丧志 若不灰心 到了时候就要收成）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:16.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皆为摩西出埃及记的典故）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:12.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（燃烧的荆棘）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:12.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（漂泊四十年）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.43,0:31:25.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你会为此下地狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才会试图跟你交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I tried to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦告诉我 你救了他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn told me you saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就该这样互相照顾 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it works with us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出时我们动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start back at sunup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟瑞克谈了谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talked to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人知道你在监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.72,0:02:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们没接受 你不会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be here if they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟其余人聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna talk to the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们也接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to accept it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没必要接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.40,0:02:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必告诉他们小女孩的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to tell them about the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得忘记那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们等待时机的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there is why we're waiting for our moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你救我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该感谢泰尔西 他当时在监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe Tyreese. He was at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这在他们的一间储藏室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in one of their storerooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他们杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不知道你做了什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't know about what you did…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道 你懂一些我不懂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know you knew some things I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你独自前行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent you away to this…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我能活下来 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I could survive. You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你独自前行 现在我们加入了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent you away to this and now we're joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意接纳我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you have us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想谈论这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得忘记这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}We surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没踪迹 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tracks. No nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不管你昨晚听到了什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever you heard last night…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有不好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more what I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人在监视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone was watching us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会出事才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}there would have been something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好踏上水泥地了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to get some concrete under your feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是悦耳啊 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is sweet music to my ears, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再遇到一条路我们就沿路走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the next road we come to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续朝北走直到发现车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to get back to going north till we find a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tighten it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,湿袜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, wet socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚凉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蚊子咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mosquito bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘙痒让你知道自己还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Itching reminds you you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,处处都有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger around every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刻也不无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,日头毒辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hot sun beating down on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,晒成漂亮的棕色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, a glorious tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是真心话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it and I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}No privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有忠实的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captive audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对那个可真是拿手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a damn expert at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么啊 - 一个小游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was it? - A little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏事里头找好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good out of the bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 来人啊 救命 - 爸爸 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help, anybody! Help! - Dad, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快啊 - 来人啊 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Anyone, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全了 注意观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're clear. Keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有武器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any weapons on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像是会有武器的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I would have any weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不管你看起来像不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't give two short and curlies what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有任何武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no weapons of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝之道足以庇护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word of god is the only protection I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去可不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure didn't look like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向天呼救 救援就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called for help. Help came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吃的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have any food?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚里的食物 都吐掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had left, it just hit the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有核桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got some pecans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个美丽的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a beautiful child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有营地吗 - 没有 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a camp? - No. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举过头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your hands above your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过多少行尸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many walkers have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一只也没有 - 转过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not any, actually. - Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过多少人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没杀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上帝憎恶暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the lord abhors violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都做过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都做过肮脏的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a sinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎每天都犯下罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sin almost every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只向上帝忏悔那些罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those sins, I confess them to god,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是向陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你有个教堂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you had a church?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在监视我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you watching us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只管自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头 活人和死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowadays, people are just as dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样危险 你们觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the dead, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 人更危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, people are worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之我没有监视你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wasn't watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾变后 我最远只去过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been beyond the stream near my church.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂边上的河流\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than a few times since it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天之前 我最远只到过那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the furthest I've gone before today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我全是骗你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm lying about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面根本没有什么教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's no church ahead at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我在把你们带向陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm leading you into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以偷走你们的松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can steal all your squirrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,教区的教徒们常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Members of my flock had often told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的幽默感令人扶额\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my sense of humor leaves much to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我们先检查一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we take a look around first?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想把松鼠拱手送人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to hold on to our squirrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿待了好几个月 连大门都没出过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent months here without stepping out the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们发现里面有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you found someone inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就奇了怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it would have been surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在后院发现一辆小巴士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a short bus out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无法发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't run,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我敢说一两天就能修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I bet we could fix that in less than a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父说他不要那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father here says he doesn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们有交通工具了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we found ourselves some transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚现在的当务之急 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand what's at stake here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然现在可以休息…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we can take a breath…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息就要拖慢进度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take a breath, we slow down,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖慢了就要出岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit inevitably goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管接下来要干嘛 我们都需要补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need supplies no matter what we do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.17,0:17:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,水 食物 弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water, food, ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short bus ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给你们找些焗豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring you back some baked beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何都要跟瑞克步调一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another, we're doing what Rick does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿别再走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not splitting up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很想跟你们走 但还是听她的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to roll with you, but… What she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠什么活了这么久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you survive here for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.59,0:17:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,补给从哪儿来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did your supplies come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,年度罐装食物捐赠活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our annual canned food drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚举行完就出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things fell apart right after we finished it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠那些食物撑了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The food lasted a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我便四处搜索补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I started scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把附近的房子都清了一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've cleaned out every place nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:17:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不去那儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kept you from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,被行尸占据了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,十多只吧 或许更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dozen or so. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能拿下十多只\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can handle a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和鲍勃跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob and I will go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰尔西留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese should stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}help keep judith safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你需要我照看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever need me to watch her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者需要我为她做任何事 我都愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}need anything for her, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grateful for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谢谢你做的其它一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你们画张地图 - 没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll draw you a map. - You don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么忙也帮不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be of any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会对付行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no good around those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不信任这个人 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't trust this guy. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么信任他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非所有人都是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody can't be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要带上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I'm bringing him with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他可能有其他同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he could have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我需要你时刻警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need you to stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮着泰尔西保护朱迪思 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and help Tyreese protect Judith, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你听好了我接下来要说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to hear what I'm about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你身边有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how many people are around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论这里看起来有多安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how clear the area looks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论其他人怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what anyone says,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你自己怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only takes one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一秒 然后就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要放松警惕 永远不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let your guard down, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:19:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你向我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我保证 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I promise. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错 我是很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I am strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们足够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然可以帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we can still help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有不测 我们也能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can handle ourselves if things go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们足够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无需害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we don't have to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没必要躲躲藏藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we don't have to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护好自己的 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay safe, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过他们没资格活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you said they don't get to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们冲破自己的底线 放弃一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We push ourselves and let things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后越放弃越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we let some more go and some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 很多事情就无法挽回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pretty soon, there's things we can't get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些原则就算我们很努力也无法坚守了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things we couldn't hold on to even if we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去华盛顿 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington's gonna happen, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没决定我们要不要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't decided if we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, and that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也看到亚伯拉罕的作战实力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've seen Abraham in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会去那 尤金会阻止灾变\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna get there and Eugene's gonna cure all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna find yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活又恢复原状了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a place where it's like how it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你变得过于麻木\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you've let too much go along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你会回到现实生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you gonna be back in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是现实生活 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the real world, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场噩梦 迟早会醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a nightmare, and nightmares end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我要决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm calling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去华盛顿 你要答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington's gonna happen. You're gonna say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼声已经很高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already too much momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能跟市政府对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't fight city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.72,0:22:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这一点是我们不能放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's just one of those parts of not letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.63,0:22:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人救了我们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved us all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是运气罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我们早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经发生的事无法改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever happened, happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重新开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想重新开始 - 你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to. - Well, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把东西留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave this here for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防在教堂遭遇不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case things go south at the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我帮你拿一个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to carry one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.34,0:23:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们在电话簿里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I didn't want to mention anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,找这个地方的时候 我不想说什么 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we looked this place up in the phone book, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得如今枪支店不可能还剩东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't imagine a gun store having leftovers nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.15,0:23:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去情况不妙 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look good, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.17,0:24:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是行尸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. It was a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.29,0:24:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是一堆箱子和一个拖把把我绊倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a stack of boxes and a mop and I tripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.03,0:24:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了我们需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got what we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真找到东西了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually found something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.81,0:24:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小冰箱里藏了三个消声器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three silencers stashed in a mini-fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,找东西的第一准则…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule number one of scavenging…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.84,0:24:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上尚存的所有东西都是藏起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing left in this world that isn't hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.36,0:24:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾是慈善食品银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the Food Bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经服务了整个郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It served the whole county.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.15,0:24:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教堂里的所有罐头都会送到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the cans at my church were gonna end up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.77,0:25:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果下水道会吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a sewer could puke,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.81,0:25:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来肯定是这个味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what it'd smell like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.10,0:25:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶漏水已经有一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water's been coming down that hole for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这里满是污水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slimed this place up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.81,0:25:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用架子挡住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use the shelves to block them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.05,0:26:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着架子下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down those shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.39,0:26:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 你要跟紧我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said you're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.21,0:26:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.73,0:26:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.49,0:26:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边我看到三只\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see three here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.08,0:26:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能应付吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.75,0:27:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去救加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.87,0:27:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.95,0:27:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.29,0:27:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.24,0:27:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们推倒这个架子 砸向前面这几只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll push down the shelves on the ones in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀过去 然后我去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fight through and I'll grab him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.67,0:27:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.42,0:28:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它们要从哪条路过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know which way it's gonna break.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.53,0:28:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 鲍勃 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Bob, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.84,0:28:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.18,0:29:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.91,0:29:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我慌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.43,0:29:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.57,0:29:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她活着时是你的熟人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew her when she was alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.41,0:29:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只对上帝坦白罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only tell your sins to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.17,0:29:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想念那把刀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you miss the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.30,0:29:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来也不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't really mine in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.04,0:29:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾变刚开始时找来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it, in the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.89,0:29:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身手为何这么好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get so good?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.29,0:29:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面除了我就是它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just me and them out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.48,0:29:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,日复一日\N{\fnArial\fs30}all day, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样过了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.39,0:29:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那是什么 但那不是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that was, but it wasn't a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.84,0:29:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.97,0:30:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三尺深的污水中举步维艰地寻找食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stumbling around in three feet of slime for some peas and carrots,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.78,0:30:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才叫生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's living.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.53,0:30:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.93,0:30:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怀念在这之前的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't miss what was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't miss that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.59,0:30:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰尔西说你在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese said you were out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.68,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 我们找到食物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. We found food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.23,0:30:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有不少呢 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A lot of it. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.05,0:30:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.94,0:30:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些划痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.49,0:30:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.52,0:30:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是用刀子划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like knives or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone was trying to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.67,0:30:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还找到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.29,0:31:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定到底发生了什么 但无论什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened, but whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.68,0:31:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都可以应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这不意味着加百利是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean Gabriel is a bad guy for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.33,0:31:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它一定意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.57,0:31:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想祝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to propose a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.10,0:31:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我环顾这个房间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look around this room…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.45,0:31:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了生存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I see survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.46,0:31:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在座的每一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each and every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.29,0:31:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都赢得了这个称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}has earned that title.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.02,0:32:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敬生存者 - 生存者 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the survivors. - Survivors! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.16,0:32:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.43,0:32:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.42,0:32:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只想当生存者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.51,0:32:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.86,0:32:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,与行尸搏斗 四处觅食\N{\fnArial\fs30}fight the undead pricks, forage for food,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.99,0:32:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜晚也无法安心入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to sleep at night with two eyes open,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.69,0:32:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样周而复始？\N{\fnArial\fs30}rinse and repeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.07,0:32:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们有实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you got the strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.73,0:32:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也有技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 对于你们来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, for you people,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.13,0:32:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你们的能力而言 那只意味着屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what you can do, that's just surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.07,0:32:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把尤金送到华盛顿 他将消灭行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we get Eugene to Washington and he will make the dead die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.91,0:32:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让活人重新掌控世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the living will have this world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然路途艰辛 但值得一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is not a bad takeaway for a little road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 特区有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, what's in DC?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.79,0:32:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们建了个基地 足以应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infrastructure constructed to withstand pandemics.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.44,0:32:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,时下的瘟疫狂潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}even of this fubar magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.27,0:33:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有食物 燃料和避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means food, fuel, refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.62,0:33:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.22,0:33:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论结果如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}However this plays out,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.23,0:33:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论花多长时间才能重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}however long it takes for the reset button to kick in,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.96,0:33:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在那里都会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,比灾变后的任一时期都安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safer than you've been since this whole thing started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.42,0:33:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为小家伙拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the world for that little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.71,0:33:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们自己拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.03,0:33:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为那些在外逃难…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it for the people out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了生存别无希望的人拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}who don't got nothing left to do except survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.13,0:34:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.08,0:34:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她知道我要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she knows what I'm about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.57,0:34:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要加入 她加入我就加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in. If she's in, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们加入 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're in. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.39,0:34:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.80,0:34:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.67,0:34:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.60,0:34:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,独享抱那孩子的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}be the only one that gets to hold that baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.61,0:34:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.62,0:34:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.49,0:35:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.97,0:35:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.85,0:35:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟总督一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.45,0:35:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时不知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.65,0:35:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what he could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不了解你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't know who all of you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.76,0:35:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I just didn't want it to be hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.92,0:35:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在跟我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.99,0:36:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢招待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.30,0:36:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然肯让我们喝你的圣餐酒让我很意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised you let us drink your communion wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.44,0:36:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人吃圣餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't anyone left to take communion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.12,0:36:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没祝福过的酒只是普通的酒罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wine's just wine until it's blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.49,0:36:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定隐瞒了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.27,0:36:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很显然是你无法逃避的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's pretty obvious it's something you can't hide from.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.35,0:36:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.96,0:36:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.65,0:36:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}these people are my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.41,0:36:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你隐瞒的事情会伤害到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if what you're hiding somehow hurts them in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.27,0:36:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.44,0:37:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.35,0:37:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.99,0:37:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.75,0:38:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.62,0:38:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝在他们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.74,0:38:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.63,0:39:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.47,0:39:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you're back with us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.96,0:39:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.10,0:39:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,松了一口气 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a relief, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.14,0:39:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别高兴的太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}But try not to read too much into the word yet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.85,0:39:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你会疯掉的 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just drive you crazy, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.35,0:39:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想解释一下自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to explain myself a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.86,0:39:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.98,0:39:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚才并不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't want to hurt you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.66,0:39:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.86,0:40:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想让你脱离团队 或吓唬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't want to pull you away from your group or scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}These aren't things that we want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.35,0:40:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're things we got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的伙伴夺走了我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your people took away our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.36,0:40:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.32,0:40:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们像其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're out here like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.51,0:40:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图在外面生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.87,0:40:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in order to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.78,0:40:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.80,0:40:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最早的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't start that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.88,0:40:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}eating people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.25,0:40:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情演化成了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It evolved into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.14,0:40:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.29,0:40:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.60,0:40:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 我们退化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we've devolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.80,0:40:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}into hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.45,0:40:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.31,0:41:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过回不去了 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it. Can't go back, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.43,0:41:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.50,0:41:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上发生的事不是私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}that nothing happening to you now is personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.86,0:41:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是你害我们落到这般境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you put us in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.79,0:41:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在躺在这里的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is almost kind of a cosmic justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是某种报应 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for it to be you, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.57,0:41:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做别人我们也会这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would have done this to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.94,0:41:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是归根结底\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.28,0:41:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们多么讨厌这种丑陋的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how much we hate all this ugly business…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.07,0:41:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总是要吃东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.44,0:42:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能让你感到安慰的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel any better…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.60,0:42:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的味道比我们想的好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taste much better than we thought you would.
